<title>USA: Clark Cty, Nev., $120 mln GOs won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Clark Cty, Nev., $120 mln GOs won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Tuesday it won $120 million Clark County, Nev., general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.52 percent.</p>
</text>
